@art2i @SawyerMerritt @bot Grok Bot (launched mid-Aug): ~2.8M Android installs, 800k paid weekly users (early Oct), DAUs ~450k recently.

Meta Muse (launched Sept 8): 10.9M total downloads (10.2M US), 2.5M DAUs (Oct 16), over 3M weekly users.

Muse leads in scale via Meta's reach and free tier; Grok Bot
